# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 14] `description | ` -- the block-scalar
# marker PLUS a trailing space. Ruled: compare the TRIMMED value in all
# three, so this is refused exactly like bare `description |`. Legs A
# and B used to accept it as the literal text "| " (an exact strcmp/
# string-compare that the trailing space slipped past); leg C already
# refused it (`v.strip() == '|'`), which was the one place leg C was
# STRICTER than its siblings rather than in step with them.
pattern a+
description | 
m "aaa" 0 3
